{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-05-04 06:30:00', 'title': "BROADRIDGE PARTNERS WITH USROWING TO SUPPORT THE U.S. WOMEN'S NATIONAL ROWING TEAM", 'text': "NEW YORK , MAY 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0USROWING IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS INC.\xa0(NYSE: BR) HAS SIGNED ON AS AN OFFICIAL USROWING PARTNER, SUPPORTING THE ORGANIZATION AND THE U.S. WOMEN'S NATIONAL TEAM. WORKING WITH USROWING, BROADRIDGE WILL LAUNCH AN ELITE ATHLETE MANAGEMENT PROGRAM, PROVIDING A POSITION FOR UP TO FIVE WOMEN U.S. ROWING NATIONAL TEAM HOPEFULS."}